    "Faq": {
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "collapse": "Click to collapse list",
      "expand": "Click to expand list and view all questions",
      "q1": "Is WohnBoard really free?",
      "a1": "Yes. WohnBoard is completely free to use. You can save apartments, track applications, manage documents, and use the browser extension without any subscription or hidden fees.",
      "q2": "Is my data secure?",
      "a2": "Yes. Your data is stored securely on European servers. WohnBoard is built with privacy in mind and follows GDPR principles to protect your personal information.",
      "q3": "What does the browser extension do?",
      "a3": "The extension lets you save apartment listings directly from supported housing websites with a single click. It sends only the listing information you choose to your WohnBoard account.",
      "q4": "Which websites are supported?",
      "a4": "WohnBoard supports many popular apartment search websites in Germany. Support is continuously expanded over time.",
      "q5": "Can I add apartments manually?",
      "a5": "Yes. If a website isn't supported yet, you can create an apartment entry manually and continue tracking your application.",
      "q6": "Can I store my application documents?",
      "a6": "Yes. Upload and securely store documents such as SCHUFA reports, payslips, IDs and other files needed for apartment applications.",
      "q7": "Can I merge my documents into one PDF?",
      "a7": "Yes. Select your documents in any order and WohnBoard will combine them into a single PDF, ready to send with your apartment application.",
      "q8": "Do I need to install the browser extension?",
      "a8": "The browser extension is the fastest way to save apartment listings. However, you can also add apartments manually if you prefer.",
      "q9": "Does WohnBoard work on mobile?",
      "a9": "You can access your WohnBoard account on mobile devices. The browser extension is currently available for desktop browsers.",
      "q10": "Why should I use WohnBoard?",
      "a10": "Apartment hunting can quickly become overwhelming. WohnBoard keeps your saved listings, applications, documents and reminders organized in one secure place."
    }
  },
